---
title: Earth Design System
summary: Led architecture and API design for the company-wide system powering marketing + product properties.
order: 1
stack: Component primitives, accessibility, theming tokens, Storybook
hero: '![Placeholder](../../src/assets/placeholder-2.jpg)'
---

A single library of primitives and patterns behind every Full Creative surface. The work was
less about components and more about the contract around them: predictable APIs, accessible
defaults that are hard to opt out of, and theming that survives a rebrand.

